---
description: Sync queue write-path rules
globs: ["lib/sync/**", "app/(field)/**"]
alwaysApply: false
---
- All field writes route through lib/sync/queue.ts. No second write path.
- client_event_id: uuid v4, one per door-visit action, shared between a
  knock_events row and its paired leads row — never independently generated.
- Idempotency relies on the existing unique constraint (Stage 2) — a
  duplicate insert is success, not an error.
- Ordering preserved per assignment_id.